OL,3,GNEWSAHow Merseyside Police is promising
OL,4,Ato tackle knife crime                  
OL,6,FMerseyside's police and crime          
OL,7,Fcommissioner Emily Spurrell said the   
OL,8,Fforce's ultimate aim was to eliminate  
OL,9,Fknife crime completely.                
